## Key Drivers to Investigate
The parameters with the widest bars are the most influential on the ICER. Focus data collection and expert elicitation on these first. In particular:

- **`n_hotspots_baseline`**: How many actionable hotspots per year? This is the denominator — more hotspots = better value for investment
- **`p_pkg_implemented`**: Will the full package actually be implemented? Institutional buy-in is critical
- **`c_pkg_setup`**: Can setup costs be reduced by leveraging existing infrastructure?
